*~

# OS
Thumbs.db

# One-shot content tooling — not needed at runtime
import
export
scripts
docs

# Markdown / prompts
*.md
prompt*.txt
prompt*.md

# Database files — only the seed DB at data/stories.db is kept; the
# rest of /data is mounted from the host at runtime.
# Volatile sqlite sidecars must never be baked into the image.
dev.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
